# Secret of a Half — native PhaseNav-Weil arithmetic operator v0.2
# Author: Adrian Lipa
# Status: prime-side explicit-formula audit; NOT a proof of RH.
#
# The arithmetic sum uses prime powers, the archimedean gamma factor, and pole terms.
# It does not consume a list of zeta zeros. TARGET_ORDINATE is a declared probe centre.
# Python parses and audits this source; Python is not the source of the construction.

